01:02:13,333 --> 01:02:19,333
The 5th Wave is a 2016 American science fiction action film directed by J Blakeson from a screenplay by
Susannah Grant, Akiva Goldsman and Jeff Pinkner, based on Rick Yancey's 2013 novel of the same name.

11
01:08:26,666 --> 01:08:32,666
The film stars Chloë Grace Moretz, Nick Robinson, Ron Livingston, Maggie
Siff, Alex Roe, Maria Bello, Maika Monroe, and Liev Schreiber.

12
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Development began in March 2012, when Columbia Pictures picked up the film rights to the trilogy of
novels, with Graham King's production company GK Films and Tobey Maguire's Material Pictures.

13
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
Filming took place in Atlanta, Georgia, from October 2014 to January 2015.

14
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The 5th Wave was released in the United States on
January 22, 2016, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

15
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
Despite negative reviews from critics, the film was moderately successful,
grossing $109.9 million worldwide against a $38–54 million budget.

16
01:39:33,333 --> 01:39:39,333
